From a003c99cc8c21972bd985cce3103f702702562ea Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: op13t-wonder source workbench <noreply@localhost>
Date: Sun, 11 Oct 2026 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/3] qdf: import WonderTap interface headers without enabling
 passthru

Source: OnePlusOSS sm8850, commit 5ab2a689ff87d7d28c511f1762cf41c1b90d965a.
Target: OnePlusOSS sm8750, commit 6a196f79f77acd55cf302e1696c038e4cad99254.
All three headers retain their upstream bytes and license notices.
The interface contract is byte-identical to the target generic Wonder header.
No Kbuild or defconfig changes; not a working backport.
